<title>MALAYSIA: Mayban Property Trust debuts at 1.44 rgt.</title>
<headline>Mayban Property Trust debuts at 1.44 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Units of Mayban Property Trust Fund One debuted on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange at 1.44 ringgit on Tuesday against an offer price of 1.28 ringgit.</p>
<p>The fund had issued three million new units to the public, with nine million units placed privately.  </p>
<p>Around 0230 GMT, the units were trading at 1.39 ringgit on volume of 2.3 million. They have traded between 1.30 and 1.44.</p>
<p>The fund is a property trust that invests in commercial properties in order to capitalise on rental and capital appreciation prospects, it said in its prospectus published earlier.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
